<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Mem is revolutionizing personal knowledge management with its self-organizing AI workspace. Unlike traditional note-taking apps that require manual organization, Mem automatically connects related information, surfaces relevant context, and helps you find exactly what you need when you need it.</p>
<p>The magic of Mem lies in its AI-powered organization system. You simply capture thoughts, ideas, meeting notes, and research without worrying about folders or tags. Mem's AI automatically identifies connections, extracts key concepts, and creates a living knowledge graph that grows smarter over time.</p>
<p>With over 100,000 users including knowledge workers, researchers, and creative professionals, Mem has proven itself as the note-taking app for people who think in connections rather than hierarchies. It's perfect for those drowning in information who need a second brain that actually understands context.</p>
<h2 id="features">Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon">🏷️</div>
<h4>Auto-tagging</h4>
<p>AI automatically tags notes with relevant topics, people, and concepts. No manual organization required - Mem handles it intelligently.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"></path></svg></div>
<h4>Smart Search</h4>
<p>Semantic search understands meaning, not just keywords. Find notes even when you can't remember exact words you used.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 3a2.828 2.828 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z"></path></svg></div>
<h4>AI Writing Assistant</h4>
<p>Generate content, expand ideas, and polish writing with built-in AI. Transform rough notes into polished documents instantly.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg></div>
<h4>Smart Collections</h4>
<p>AI automatically creates collections of related notes. Discover connections you didn't know existed in your knowledge base.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div>
<h4>Quick Capture</h4>
<p>Capture thoughts instantly from anywhere with keyboard shortcuts, mobile app, or email. Friction-free note creation.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon">📄</div>
<h4>Smart Templates</h4>
<p>Pre-built templates for meetings, research, and projects. AI suggests templates based on your content.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg></div>
<h4>Bi-directional Links</h4>
<p>Automatic linking between related notes creates a knowledge graph. See connections across your entire knowledge base.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="12" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 014 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 014-10z"></path></svg></div>
<h4>Integrations</h4>
<p>Connect with Slack, Gmail, Calendar, and more. Import information from all your tools into one intelligent workspace.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h3>The Self-Organizing Workspace</h3>
<p>Mem's killer feature is its ability to organize itself. As you add notes, Mem builds a semantic understanding of your knowledge base. It identifies patterns, suggests connections, and surfaces relevant information when you're working on related topics. It's like having a librarian who knows your entire collection and anticipates what you need.</p>
<h2 id="pros-cons">Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Advantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Zero manual organization needed</li>
<li>Exceptional AI search capabilities</li>
<li>Automatic note connections</li>
<li>Clean, minimalist interface</li>
<li>Fast and responsive</li>
<li>Great mobile apps</li>
<li>AI writing assistant included</li>
<li>Smart auto-tagging</li>
<li>Email integration</li>
<li>Knowledge graph visualization</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="cons-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg> Disadvantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Expensive compared to alternatives</li>
<li>Limited formatting options</li>
<li>No offline access</li>
<li>Learning curve for AI features</li>
<li>Limited collaboration features</li>
<li>No free tier (only trial)</li>
<li>Smaller ecosystem than Notion</li>
<li>Can't export easily</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
